{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00392",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 2.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Hello again. Come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.96,
      "end_seconds": 3.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Hi, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.62,
      "end_seconds": 6.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.82,
      "end_seconds": 22.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.18,
      "text": "I'm here because of fever with chills. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.44,
      "end_seconds": 25.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.29,
      "end_seconds": 33.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly. Okay, you know, so I've been feeling very weak too, since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.13,
      "end_seconds": 36.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Has there been nausea too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.62,
      "end_seconds": 39.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.66,
      "end_seconds": 43.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.82,
      "end_seconds": 44.7,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.78,
      "end_seconds": 63.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let me check a few things. Any breathlessness, vomiting, cough or diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.2,
      "end_seconds": 69.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "I mean, I haven't had breathlessness, vomiting, cough or diarrhoea, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.52,
      "end_seconds": 71.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Right, any stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.32,
      "end_seconds": 76.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Oh, no, I haven't had any stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.37,
      "end_seconds": 80.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.3,
      "end_seconds": 83.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.34,
      "end_seconds": 100.65,
      "duration_seconds": 16.31,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.18,
      "end_seconds": 102.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 103.93,
      "end_seconds": 112.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pulse 102, temp 39.2 degrees, SpO2 96 percent on room air, blood pressure 118 over 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.0,
      "end_seconds": 116.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Thanks. Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.11,
      "end_seconds": 120.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.02,
      "end_seconds": 123.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.94,
      "end_seconds": 125.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.11,
      "end_seconds": 143.48,
      "duration_seconds": 14.37,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.11,
      "end_seconds": 146.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.34,
      "end_seconds": 150.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.95,
      "end_seconds": 153.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Hmm, not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.54,
      "end_seconds": 157.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.28,
      "end_seconds": 173.26,
      "duration_seconds": 14.98,
      "text": "Hmm, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.13,
      "end_seconds": 177.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.6,
      "end_seconds": 187.99,
      "duration_seconds": 10.39,
      "text": "I've, I've had eczema for five years now. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.89,
      "end_seconds": 192.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Okay, eczema, that's already on your record. Good to know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.03,
      "end_seconds": 196.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Okay, I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.83,
      "end_seconds": 197.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.16,
      "end_seconds": 212.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Are you on any tablets or medication? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.75,
      "end_seconds": 216.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "I take hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.97,
      "end_seconds": 217.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.88,
      "end_seconds": 221.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.05,
      "end_seconds": 224.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Let me just write this down properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.18,
      "end_seconds": 236.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Good, where were we."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.84,
      "end_seconds": 240.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.77,
      "end_seconds": 243.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.17,
      "end_seconds": 265.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Your spleen tip is just palpable under the ribs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.26,
      "end_seconds": 278.28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.79,
      "end_seconds": 280.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.84,
      "end_seconds": 283.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.5,
      "end_seconds": 306.51,
      "duration_seconds": 16.01,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with malaria until proven otherwise at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Dengue fever is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.8,
      "end_seconds": 309.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.24,
      "end_seconds": 323.81,
      "duration_seconds": 12.57,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now malaria until proven otherwise is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had fever with chills, severe, and no vomiting or cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.8,
      "end_seconds": 326.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.96,
      "end_seconds": 330.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.52,
      "end_seconds": 334.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Um, yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.1,
      "end_seconds": 353.38,
      "duration_seconds": 18.28,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for fever. We should do a malaria test for fever after travel. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Let the lab know you travelled recently, that's important for the tests. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.41,
      "end_seconds": 362.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "If you get confused, very drowsy, or the shaking returns, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.28,
      "end_seconds": 366.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "So, yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.64,
      "end_seconds": 377.54,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "text": "Please come and see me in two days. Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.19,
      "end_seconds": 382.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "So, I come back in two days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.64,
      "end_seconds": 388.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.55,
      "end_seconds": 391.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}